{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/extras/8d76b6f113dec3057c941580dbea3367.avif?t=1760650003\" width=1200 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Une histoire de succ\u00e8s n\u00e9e de la solitude, des dettes et de la salet\u00e9.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Votre femme vous a quitt\u00e9. Vous avez perdu votre maison. Votre vie est en ruine.<br>Juste au moment o\u00f9 tout semblait perdu\u2026 un flyer vous tombe sur la t\u00eate :<br><strong>&quot;\u00c0 Louer : Anciennes Toilettes de Gare Routi\u00e8re&quot;</strong><br>Et ainsi commence Toilet Simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/extras/d40e54a7fc979616eb0ca3bec4c6dea7.poster.avif?t=1760650003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/extras/d40e54a7fc979616eb0ca3bec4c6dea7.webm?t=1760650003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/extras/d40e54a7fc979616eb0ca3bec4c6dea7.mp4?t=1760650003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/extras/40f0137e4bb4f6d7ebfbb1bc51a96c00.webp?t=1760650003\" width=519 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/extras/353558fb9525485bde91b85d2210b6af.poster.avif?t=1760650003\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/extras/353558fb9525485bde91b85d2210b6af.webm?t=1760650003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/extras/353558fb9525485bde91b85d2210b6af.mp4?t=1760650003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prenez en charge des toilettes publiques abandonn\u00e9es et transformez-les en temple de l\u2019hygi\u00e8ne.<br>Nettoyez, d\u00e9corez, choisissez vos toilettes, placez les distributeurs de savon.<br>Mais attention : ce n\u2019est que le d\u00e9but.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/extras/e80d3d95b44236ddec365a9c6425c151.webp?t=1760650003\" width=401 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/extras/7c3a3eb01ffb47e3d47ddbbdcb6a9eb3.poster.avif?t=1760650003\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/extras/7c3a3eb01ffb47e3d47ddbbdcb6a9eb3.webm?t=1760650003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/extras/7c3a3eb01ffb47e3d47ddbbdcb6a9eb3.mp4?t=1760650003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luttez contre des pervers, voleurs et mafieux</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ramassez les ordures, r\u00e9parez les objets cass\u00e9s, achetez des produits de nettoyage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gardez les clients satisfaits \u2013 sinon, ils ne reviendront pas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixez vous-m\u00eame le tarif d\u2019utilisation des toilettes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mangez, faites du shopping, buvez un coup \u2013 tout est possible dans le terminal !</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/extras/6d6e7efcd6c6e29328cfd723d8235b1f.webp?t=1760650003\" width=336 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dans cette d\u00e9mo, seules les <strong>missions tutoriel</strong> sont disponibles.<br>La version Acc\u00e8s Anticip\u00e9 d\u00e9bloquera toutes les autres missions et contenus.<br>Terminez la d\u00e9mo pour apprendre les m\u00e9caniques du jeu et vous pr\u00e9parer \u00e0 la version compl\u00e8te.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3314740?t=1760650003","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/bd4da677ca383663cfe1cb6c03e7745dd6a5f2b8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760650003","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/a4d54f869d9e95a8cd82dd7397d80f0df69022d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760650003","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/a4d54f869d9e95a8cd82dd7397d80f0df69022d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760650003","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314740/extras/8d76b6f113dec3057c941580dbea3367.avif?t=1760650003\" width=1200 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Une histoire de succ\u00e8s n\u00e9e de la solitude, des dettes et de la salet\u00e9.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Votre femme vous a quitt\u00e9. Vous avez perdu votre maison. Votre vie est en ruine.<b